msgstr "Kontak"

#: includes/mcp/ability-registry.php:41
msgid "Use the exact input types shown in discovery."
msgstr "Gunakan tipe input yang tepat seperti yang ditunjukkan dalam penemuan."

#: includes/mcp/ability-registry.php:77
msgid "List capabilities"
msgstr "Daftar kemampuan"

#: includes/mcp/ability-registry.php:78
msgid ""
"List known role, post-type and taxonomy capabilities, optionally filtered "
"by name."
msgstr ""
"Daftar kemampuan peran, tipe pos, dan taksonomi yang diketahui, dapat "
"difilter secara opsional berdasarkan nama."

#: includes/mcp/ability-registry.php:86
msgid "Compare roles"
msgstr "Bandingkan peran"

#: includes/mcp/ability-registry.php:87
msgid ""
"Compare stored role grants and denials. Null means a capability is absent, "
"false means explicitly denied."
msgstr ""
"Bandingkan pemberian dan penolakan peran yang disimpan. Null berarti "
"kemampuan tidak ada, false berarti secara eksplisit ditolak."

#: includes/mcp/ability-registry.php:95
msgid "Create role"
msgstr "Buat peran"

#: includes/mcp/ability-registry.php:96
msgid ""
"Create an empty role or copy capabilities from source_role. Does not "
"overwrite an existing role. Use update-role-capabilities for grants. MCP "
"refuses copying administrator-level capabilities."
msgstr ""
"Buat peran kosong atau salin kemampuan dari source_role. Tidak menimpa "
"peran yang sudah ada. Gunakan update-role-capabilities untuk pemberian. MCP "
"menolak penyalinan kemampuan tingkat administrator."

#: includes/mcp/ability-registry.php:106
msgid "Rename role"
msgstr "Ganti nama peran"

#: includes/mcp/ability-registry.php:107
msgid ""
"Change a role display name while retaining its slug, users, settings and "
"capabilities."
msgstr ""
"Ubah nama tampilan peran sambil mempertahankan slug, pengguna, pengaturan, "
"dan kemampuan."

#: includes/mcp/ability-registry.php:116
#: includes/roles/class/class-pp-roles-admin.php:259
msgid "Delete role"
msgstr "Hapus peran"

#: includes/mcp/ability-registry.php:117
msgid ""
"Delete a custom editable role. Existing users with no remaining role move "
"to the site default. System/default/own roles are protected."
msgstr ""
"Hapus peran kustom yang dapat diedit. Pengguna yang ada tanpa peran tersisa "
"akan pindah ke default situs. Peran sistem/default/sendiri dilindungi."

#: includes/mcp/ability-registry.php:127
msgid "Update role capabilities"
msgstr "Perbarui kemampuan peran"

#: includes/mcp/ability-registry.php:128
msgid ""
"Patch capabilities: grant=true, deny=false, remove=unset. Unmentioned "
"capabilities remain unchanged. Use dry_run to inspect before/after without "
"saving. Changes are validated before writes. MCP refuses new "
"administrator-level grants, including in dry runs."
msgstr ""
"Patch kemampuan: grant=true, deny=false, remove=unset. Kemampuan yang tidak "
"disebutkan tetap tidak berubah. Gunakan dry_run untuk memeriksa "
"sebelum/setelah tanpa menyimpan. Perubahan divalidasi sebelum penulisan. "
"MCP menolak pemberian tingkat administrator baru, termasuk dalam dry run."

#: includes/mcp/ability-registry.php:146
msgid "Get role options"
msgstr "Dapatkan opsi peran"

#: includes/mcp/ability-registry.php:147
msgid ""
"Read role editor preference, login/dashboard access and assignment "
"disabling settings."
msgstr ""
"Baca preferensi editor peran, akses login/dashboard, dan pengaturan "
"penonaktifan penugasan."

#: includes/mcp/ability-registry.php:155
msgid "Update role options"
msgstr "Perbarui opsi peran"

#: includes/mcp/ability-registry.php:156
msgid ""
"Patch role options without changing capabilities. "
"Administrator/default/own-role lockout protections apply."
msgstr ""
"Patch opsi peran tanpa mengubah kemampuan. Perlindungan kunci untuk "
"administrator/default/peran-sendiri berlaku."

#: includes/mcp/ability-registry.php:189
msgid "List features"
msgstr "Daftar fitur"

#: includes/mcp/ability-registry.php:190
msgid ""
"Discover all Capabilities menus, enabled states, permission names and "
"supported configuration fields."
msgstr ""
"Temukan semua menu Kemampuan, status yang diaktifkan, nama izin, dan bidang "
"konfigurasi yang didukung."

#: includes/mcp/ability-registry.php:198
msgid "Set feature enabled"
msgstr "Tetapkan fitur diaktifkan"

#: includes/mcp/ability-registry.php:199
msgid ""
"Enable or disable a Capabilities dashboard feature on this site. Disabled "
"features reject their configuration actions."
msgstr ""
"Aktifkan atau nonaktifkan fitur dashboard Kemampuan di situs ini. Fitur "
"yang dinonaktifkan menolak tindakan konfigurasinya."

#: includes/mcp/ability-registry.php:208
msgid "Get feature choices"
msgstr "Dapatkan pilihan fitur"

#: includes/mcp/ability-registry.php:209
msgid ""
"Discover existing editor/admin elements, captured profile/frontend "
"elements, menu snapshots with exact restriction_value identifiers, "
"navigation items or admin style templates. Does not capture new browser UI."
msgstr ""
"Temukan elemen editor/admin yang ada, elemen profil/frontend yang "
"ditangkap, snapshot menu dengan pengidentifikasi restriction_value yang "
"tepat, item navigasi atau template gaya admin. Tidak menangkap UI browser "
"baru."

#: includes/mcp/ability-registry.php:217
msgid "Get feature settings"
msgstr "Dapatkan pengaturan fitur"

#: includes/mcp/ability-registry.php:218
msgid ""
"Read a role's settings for an enabled feature. Editor restrictions are "
"specific to post_type and editor. Navigation also supports ppc_guest and "
"ppc_users."
msgstr ""
"Baca pengaturan peran untuk fitur yang diaktifkan. Pembatasan editor "
"spesifik untuk post_type dan editor. Navigasi juga mendukung ppc_guest dan "
"ppc_users."

#: includes/mcp/ability-registry.php:232
msgid "Update feature settings"
msgstr "Perbarui pengaturan fitur"

#: includes/mcp/ability-registry.php:233
msgid ""
"Patch feature settings for one role. List fields replace their lists; "
"unmentioned fields and other roles remain unchanged. dry_run validates and "
"returns proposed values without saving. Discover fields with list-features. "
"For admin-menus, first get-feature-choices and use discovery "
"restriction_value identifiers. New unknown menu identifiers are rejected."
msgstr ""
"Patch pengaturan fitur untuk satu peran. Bidang daftar menggantikan daftar "
"mereka; bidang yang tidak disebutkan dan peran lainnya tetap tidak berubah. "
"dry_run memvalidasi dan mengembalikan nilai yang diusulkan tanpa menyimpan. "
"Temukan bidang dengan list-features. Untuk menu admin, pertama "
"dapatkan-feature-choices dan gunakan pengidentifikasi restriction_value "
"penemuan. Pengidentifikasi menu baru yang tidak dikenal ditolak."

#: includes/mcp/ability-registry.php:246
msgid "Bulk update feature settings"
msgstr "Perbarui pengaturan fitur secara massal"

#: includes/mcp/ability-registry.php:247
msgid ""
"Apply the same feature settings to multiple roles, validating all targets "
"before writing. dry_run returns proposed settings only."
msgstr ""
"Terapkan pengaturan fitur yang sama ke beberapa peran, memvalidasi semua "
"target sebelum menulis. dry_run hanya mengembalikan pengaturan yang "
"diusulkan."

#: includes/mcp/ability-registry.php:256
msgid "Get plugin settings"
msgstr "Dapatkan pengaturan plugin"

#: includes/mcp/ability-registry.php:257
msgid ""
"Read Capabilities > Settings and the supported setting descriptions. "
"Includes Roles > Multiples roles on Add New User and User Edit (Edit User), "
"Editor Features > Show private post types, Capabilities visibility, User "
"Testing, Admin Menus and Pro settings."
msgstr ""
"Baca Kemampuan > Pengaturan dan deskripsi pengaturan yang didukung. "
"Termasuk Peran > Beberapa peran pada Tambah Pengguna Baru dan Edit Pengguna "
"(Edit User), Fitur Editor > Tampilkan jenis pos pribadi, visibilitas "
"Kemampuan, Pengujian Pengguna, Menu Admin dan pengaturan Pro."

#: includes/mcp/ability-registry.php:265
msgid "Update plugin settings"
msgstr "Perbarui pengaturan plugin"

#: includes/mcp/ability-registry.php:266
msgid ""
"Enable, disable or update Capabilities > Settings options. Supports "
"multiple roles on Add New User or User Edit (Edit User), Show private post "
"types under Editor Features or Capabilities, User Testing and Admin Menus "
"settings. Read get-plugin-settings to identify the exact field. Change only "
"the requested field. This saves individual settings, unlike "
"set-feature-enabled which toggles whole screens."
msgstr ""
"Aktifkan, nonaktifkan, atau perbarui opsi Kemampuan > Pengaturan. Mendukung "
"beberapa peran pada Tambah Pengguna Baru atau Edit Pengguna (Edit User), "
"Tampilkan jenis pos pribadi di bawah Fitur Editor atau Kemampuan, Pengujian "
"Pengguna, dan pengaturan Menu Admin. Baca get-plugin-settings untuk "
"mengidentifikasi bidang yang tepat. Ubah hanya bidang yang diminta. Ini "
"menyimpan pengaturan individu, tidak seperti set-feature-enabled yang "
"mengubah seluruh layar."

#: includes/mcp/ability-registry.php:283
msgid "List backups"
msgstr "Daftar cadangan"

#: includes/mcp/ability-registry.php:284
msgid ""
"List saved manual, initial and automatic Capabilities role backups. Returns "
"identifiers for restore-backup."
msgstr ""
"Daftar cadangan peran Kemampuan manual, awal, dan otomatis yang disimpan. "
"Mengembalikan pengidentifikasi untuk restore-backup."

#: includes/mcp/ability-registry.php:292
msgid "Create backup"
msgstr "Buat cadangan"

#: includes/mcp/ability-registry.php:293
msgid ""
"Save the current roles and plugin feature settings using the existing "
"manual backup format. Replaces the last manual backup."
msgstr ""
"Simpan pengaturan peran dan fitur plugin saat ini menggunakan format "
"cadangan manual yang ada. Menggantikan cadangan manual terakhir."

#: includes/mcp/ability-registry.php:303
msgid "Restore backup"
msgstr "Pulihkan cadangan"

#: includes/mcp/ability-registry.php:304
msgid ""
"Restore a listed backup. Manual backups include feature settings; "
"initial/automatic backups restore roles. Use dry_run before applying."
msgstr ""
"Pulihkan cadangan yang terdaftar. Cadangan manual mencakup pengaturan "
"fitur; cadangan awal/otomatis memulihkan peran. Gunakan dry_run sebelum "
"menerapkan."

#: includes/mcp/ability-registry.php:313
msgid "Export configuration"
msgstr "Ekspor konfigurasi"

#: includes/mcp/ability-registry.php:314
msgid ""
"Export plugin-owned configuration in the same allowlisted format used by "
"the Backup screen. Returns available_sections for selective export and "
"optionally filters user_roles by role slug. Contains permission "
"configuration, not password secrets."
msgstr ""
"Ekspor konfigurasi yang dimiliki plugin dalam format yang sama yang "
"diizinkan oleh layar Cadangan. Mengembalikan available_sections untuk "
"ekspor selektif dan secara opsional memfilter user_roles berdasarkan slug "
"peran. Berisi konfigurasi izin, bukan rahasia kata sandi."

#: includes/mcp/ability-registry.php:323
msgid "Import configuration"
msgstr "Impor konfigurasi"

#: includes/mcp/ability-registry.php:324
msgid ""
"Validate and import a configuration export using the existing backup "
"validators. Reject unsupported entries before writing; dry_run validates "
"without saving. MCP rejects new administrator-level grants."
msgstr ""
"Validasi dan impor ekspor konfigurasi menggunakan validator cadangan yang "
"ada. Tolak entri yang tidak didukung sebelum menulis; dry_run memvalidasi "
"tanpa menyimpan. MCP menolak pemberian tingkat administrator baru."

#: includes/mcp/ability-registry.php:344
msgid "Save interface element"
msgstr "Simpan elemen antarmuka"

#: includes/mcp/ability-registry.php:345
msgid ""
"Create or update a profile selector or frontend selector/CSS/body-class "
"element. Does not enable it for a role; use update-feature-settings "
"afterwards."
msgstr ""
"Buat atau perbarui pemilih profil atau pemilih frontend/elemen "
"CSS/body-class. Tidak mengaktifkannya untuk peran; gunakan "
"pengaturan-fitur-perbarui setelahnya."

#: includes/mcp/ability-registry.php:363
msgid "Delete interface element"
msgstr "Hapus elemen antarmuka"

#: includes/mcp/ability-registry.php:364
msgid ""
"Delete a profile/frontend element and remove its saved restriction "
"references."
msgstr ""
"Hapus elemen profil/frontend dan hilangkan referensi pembatasan yang "
"disimpan."

#: includes/mcp/ability-registry.php:374
msgid "Update admin menu presentation"
msgstr "Perbarui presentasi menu admin"

#: includes/mcp/ability-registry.php:375
msgid ""
"Rename menus for a role, set global menu/submenu ordering, update menu UI "
"settings, or reset custom presentation. This does not change capabilities."
msgstr ""
"Ganti nama menu untuk peran, atur urutan menu/submenu global, perbarui "
"pengaturan UI menu, atau reset presentasi kustom. Ini tidak mengubah "
"kemampuan."

#: includes/mcp/ability-registry.php:394
msgid "Save admin style"
msgstr "Simpan gaya admin"

#: includes/mcp/ability-registry.php:395
msgid ""
"Create/update a named custom admin color style using existing sanitizers "
"and CSS generation. Free supports one custom style; Pro supports multiple."
msgstr ""
"Buat/perbarui gaya warna admin kustom yang dinamai menggunakan sanitizers "
"yang ada dan generasi CSS. Versi gratis mendukung satu gaya kustom; Pro "
"mendukung beberapa."

#: includes/mcp/ability-registry.php:409
msgid "Delete admin style"
msgstr "Hapus gaya admin"

#: includes/mcp/ability-registry.php:410
msgid ""
"Delete a custom admin style and its generated CSS. Roles using it return to "
"the default color scheme."
msgstr ""
"Hapus gaya admin kustom dan CSS yang dihasilkannya. Peran yang "
"menggunakannya kembali ke skema warna default."

#: includes/mcp/ability-registry.php:424
msgid "List application password scopes"
msgstr "Daftar ruang lingkup kata sandi aplikasi"

#: includes/mcp/ability-registry.php:425
msgid ""
"List manageable application password names and denied capabilities. Returns "
"no plaintext passwords or hashes. Requires the application-password "
"capabilities feature to be enabled."
msgstr ""
"Daftar nama kata sandi aplikasi yang dapat dikelola dan kemampuan yang "
"ditolak. Tidak mengembalikan kata sandi plaintext atau hash. Memerlukan "
"fitur kemampuan kata sandi aplikasi untuk diaktifkan."

#: includes/mcp/ability-registry.php:435
msgid "Update application password scope"
msgstr "Perbarui ruang lingkup kata sandi aplikasi"

#: includes/mcp/ability-registry.php:436
msgid ""
"Replace the denied capability list for one application password. "
"Restrictions only reduce its user's capabilities; they do not grant "
"privileges."
msgstr ""
"Ganti daftar kemampuan yang ditolak untuk satu kata sandi aplikasi. "
"Pembatasan hanya mengurangi kemampuan pengguna; mereka tidak memberikan hak "
"istimewa."

#: includes/mcp/ability-registry.php:452
msgid "Update user roles"
msgstr "Perbarui peran pengguna"

#: includes/mcp/ability-registry.php:453
msgid ""
"Replace an existing site user's assigned roles using the profile form "
"rules. Requires multiple-role editing to be enabled, preserves forum roles, "
"and supports dry_run. Newly assigned administrator-level roles are refused "
"by MCP."
msgstr ""
"Ganti peran yang ditugaskan kepada pengguna situs yang ada menggunakan "
"aturan formulir profil. Memerlukan pengeditan beberapa peran untuk "
"diaktifkan, mempertahankan peran forum, dan mendukung dry_run. Peran "
"tingkat administrator yang baru ditugaskan ditolak oleh MCP."

#: includes/mcp/ability-registry.php:478
msgid "Get user capabilities"
msgstr "Dapatkan kemampuan pengguna"

#: includes/mcp/ability-registry.php:479
msgid ""
"Inspect a site member's roles and effective capability values, as on the "
"User Capabilities screen. No identity switching or user changes."
msgstr ""
"Periksa peran anggota situs dan nilai kemampuan efektif, seperti pada layar "
"Kemampuan Pengguna. Tidak ada pengalihan identitas atau perubahan pengguna."

#: includes/mcp/ability-registry.php:487
msgid "Check user capability"
msgstr "Periksa kemampuan pengguna"

#: includes/mcp/ability-registry.php:488
msgid ""
"Test a user's effective permission, optionally for an object ID. Applies "
"WordPress permission filters without impersonating that user or changing "
"the MCP session."
msgstr ""
"Uji izin efektif pengguna, opsional untuk ID objek. Menerapkan filter izin "
"WordPress tanpa menyamar sebagai pengguna tersebut atau mengubah sesi MCP."

#: includes/mcp/advanced-operations.php:29
msgid "Choose an editable role for profile capture."
msgstr "Pilih peran yang dapat diedit untuk penangkapan profil."

#: includes/mcp/advanced-operations.php:74
msgid "A post type or taxonomy does not exist."
msgstr "Sebuah post type atau taxonomy tidak ada."

#: includes/mcp/advanced-operations.php:130
msgid "Post not found."
msgstr "Post tidak ditemukan."

#: includes/mcp/advanced-operations.php:136
msgid "A frontend element does not exist."
msgstr "Sebuah elemen frontend tidak ada."

#: includes/mcp/advanced-operations.php:153
msgid "Invalid menu slug."
msgstr "Slug menu tidak valid."

#: includes/mcp/advanced-operations.php:157
msgid "Custom menu not found."
msgstr "Menu kustom tidak ditemukan."

#: includes/mcp/advanced-operations.php:162
msgid "Title, capability and submenu parent are required."
msgstr "Judul, kemampuan, dan induk submenu diperlukan."

#: includes/mcp/advanced-operations.php:165
msgid "Unsupported menu URL."
msgstr "URL menu tidak didukung."

#: includes/mcp/advanced-registry.php:33
msgid "Prepare profile capture"
msgstr "Siapkan penangkapan profil"

#: includes/mcp/advanced-registry.php:34
msgid ""
"Enable/disable the existing five-minute profile capture window and return "
"the admin page to visit. Actual DOM capture runs in the browser with its "
"own authenticated session."
msgstr ""
"Aktifkan/nonaktifkan jendela penangkapan profil lima menit yang ada dan "
"kembalikan halaman admin untuk dikunjungi. Penangkapan DOM yang sebenarnya "
"dijalankan di browser dengan sesi terautentikasi sendiri."

#: includes/mcp/advanced-registry.php:46
msgid "Update admin feature UI settings"
msgstr "Perbarui pengaturan UI fitur admin"

#: includes/mcp/advanced-registry.php:47
msgid ""
"Set the Admin Features hide-submenu preference. This is a global "
"presentation preference, not a role access rule."
msgstr ""
"Atur preferensi hide-submenu Fitur Admin. Ini adalah preferensi presentasi "
"global, bukan aturan akses peran."

#: includes/mcp/advanced-registry.php:58
msgid "Get type capability settings"
msgstr "Dapatkan pengaturan kemampuan tipe"

#: includes/mcp/advanced-registry.php:59
msgid ""
"Read type-specific post/taxonomy capability mappings and discover "
"registered types."
msgstr ""
"Baca pemetaan kemampuan post/taxonomy spesifik tipe dan temukan tipe yang "
"terdaftar."

#: includes/mcp/advanced-registry.php:67
msgid "Update type capability settings"
msgstr "Perbarui pengaturan kemampuan tipe"

#: includes/mcp/advanced-registry.php:68
msgid ""
"Patch type-specific capabilities and detailed taxonomy mapping. Detailed "
"taxonomies also enable type-specific capabilities. Takes effect on the next "
"request."
msgstr ""
"Patch kemampuan spesifik tipe dan pemetaan taxonomy yang terperinci. "
"Taxonomy terperinci juga mengaktifkan kemampuan spesifik tipe. Berlaku pada "
"permintaan berikutnya."

#: includes/mcp/advanced-registry.php:77
msgid "Set role level"
msgstr "Atur tingkat peran"

#: includes/mcp/advanced-registry.php:78
msgid ""
"Set a legacy WordPress role level from 0 to 10. Administrator stays at "
"level 10. dry_run previews capability changes."
msgstr ""
"Atur tingkat peran WordPress lama dari 0 hingga 10. Administrator tetap "
"pada tingkat 10. dry_run melihat pratinjau perubahan kemampuan."

#: includes/mcp/advanced-registry.php:87
msgid "Reset roles"
msgstr "Reset peran"

#: includes/mcp/advanced-registry.php:88
msgid ""
"Role reset requires the native Backup screen. MCP refuses recovery hooks "
"that could introduce administrator-level grants."
msgstr ""
"Reset peran memerlukan layar Backup asli. MCP menolak hook pemulihan yang "
"dapat memperkenalkan pemberian tingkat administrator."

#: includes/mcp/advanced-registry.php:98
msgid "Test user access"
msgstr "Uji akses pengguna"

#: includes/mcp/advanced-registry.php:99
msgid ""
"Test an eligible user’s permission through the User Testing access rules "
"without switching cookies or the MCP identity."
msgstr ""
"Uji izin pengguna yang memenuhi syarat melalui aturan akses Pengujian "
"Pengguna tanpa mengganti cookie atau identitas MCP."

#: includes/mcp/advanced-registry.php:113
msgid "Sync role network"
msgstr "Sinkronkan jaringan peran"

#: includes/mcp/advanced-registry.php:114
msgid ""
"Queue the existing role/capability and option synchronization across "
"network sites. Requires a main-site network administrator. MCP refuses "
"synchronization of roles with administrator-level capabilities."
msgstr ""
"Antri sinkronisasi peran/kepemilikan yang ada dan opsi di seluruh situs "
"jaringan. Memerlukan administrator jaringan situs utama. MCP menolak "
"sinkronisasi peran dengan kemampuan tingkat administrator."

#: includes/mcp/advanced-registry.php:135
msgid "Get post frontend elements"
msgstr "Dapatkan elemen frontend pos"

#: includes/mcp/advanced-registry.php:136
msgid ""
"Read a post’s frontend element overrides (Pro), respecting edit_post "
"permission."
msgstr "Baca penggantian elemen frontend pos (Pro), menghormati izin edit_post."

#: includes/mcp/advanced-registry.php:144
msgid "Set post frontend elements"
msgstr "Atur elemen frontend pos"

#: includes/mcp/advanced-registry.php:145
msgid ""
"Replace a post’s enabled frontend element overrides (Pro). Empty list "
"clears them."
msgstr ""
"Ganti penggantian elemen frontend yang diaktifkan pos (Pro). Daftar kosong "
"menghapusnya."

#: includes/mcp/advanced-registry.php:154
msgid "Manage custom admin menu"
msgstr "Kelola menu admin kustom"

#: includes/mcp/advanced-registry.php:155
msgid ""
"Create/update/delete a custom admin menu or separator (Pro). Menu data "
"contains no executable callbacks. Refreshes menu snapshots."
msgstr ""
"Buat/perbarui/hapus menu admin kustom atau pemisah (Pro). Data menu tidak "
"mengandung callback yang dapat dieksekusi. Memperbarui snapshot menu."

#: includes/mcp/backup-operations.php:36
msgid "Choose section identifiers returned by export discovery."
msgstr "Pilih pengidentifikasi bagian yang dikembalikan oleh penemuan ekspor."

#: includes/mcp/backup-operations.php:39
msgid "Role selection requires the user_roles export section."
msgstr "Pemilihan peran memerlukan bagian ekspor user_roles."

#: includes/mcp/backup-operations.php:47
msgid "An export role does not exist."
msgstr "Peran ekspor tidak ada."

#: includes/mcp/backup-operations.php:97
msgid "Choose a backup returned by list-backups."
msgstr "Pilih cadangan yang dikembalikan oleh daftar-cadangan."

#: includes/mcp/backup-operations.php:118
msgid "Configuration contains an unsupported setting."
msgstr "Konfigurasi mengandung pengaturan yang tidak didukung."

#: includes/mcp/backup-operations.php:124
msgid "Invalid role definitions."
msgstr "Definisi peran tidak valid."

#: includes/mcp/backup-operations.php:141
msgid "The administrator role must retain access to WordPress and Capabilities."
msgstr "Peran administrator harus mempertahankan akses ke WordPress dan Kemampuan."

#: includes/mcp/backup-operations.php:144
msgid "Imported roles must include the default role."
msgstr "Peran yang diimpor harus mencakup peran default."

#: includes/mcp/backup-operations.php:149
msgid "Invalid configuration value."
msgstr "Nilai konfigurasi tidak valid."

#: includes/mcp/backup-operations.php:155
msgid "No configuration was supplied."
msgstr "Tidak ada konfigurasi yang disuplai."

#: includes/mcp/bootstrap.php:68
msgid "Actions provided by PublishPress plugins."
msgstr "Tindakan yang disediakan oleh plugin PublishPress."

#: includes/mcp/custom-rule-operations.php:57
msgid "A label and selector or URL are required."
msgstr "Label dan pemilih atau URL diperlukan."

#: includes/mcp/custom-rule-operations.php:79
msgid "Custom rule not found."
msgstr "Aturan kustom tidak ditemukan."

#: includes/mcp/custom-rule-operations.php:110
msgid "List custom rules"
msgstr "Daftar aturan kustom"

#: includes/mcp/custom-rule-operations.php:111
msgid ""
"List Pro custom editor selectors, hidden admin elements or blocked URLs, "
"including the exact restriction values used by feature settings."
msgstr ""
"Daftar pemilih editor kustom Pro, elemen admin tersembunyi, atau URL yang "
"diblokir, termasuk nilai pembatasan yang tepat digunakan oleh pengaturan "
"fitur."

#: includes/mcp/custom-rule-operations.php:119
msgid "Save custom rule"
msgstr "Simpan aturan kustom"

#: includes/mcp/custom-rule-operations.php:120
msgid ""
"Create/update a Pro custom editor selector, admin CSS hiding rule or "
"blocked-URL rule. Save its restriction_value in the role feature settings "
"to enable it."
msgstr ""
"Buat/perbarui pemilih editor kustom Pro, aturan CSS admin yang "
"menyembunyikan, atau aturan URL yang diblokir. Simpan restriction_value-nya "
"dalam pengaturan fitur peran untuk mengaktifkannya."

#: includes/mcp/custom-rule-operations.php:131
msgid "Delete custom rule"
msgstr "Hapus aturan kustom"

#: includes/mcp/custom-rule-operations.php:132
msgid "Delete a Pro custom restriction rule and its role restriction references."
msgstr "Hapus aturan pembatasan kustom Pro dan referensi pembatasan perannya."

#: includes/mcp/feature-operations.php:82
msgid "Unknown feature."
msgstr "Fitur tidak dikenal."

#: includes/mcp/feature-operations.php:90
msgid "This post type is not available in Editor Features."
msgstr "Tipe pos ini tidak tersedia di Fitur Editor."

